    "authored_date": "2026-07-18",
    "deviation_notes": "Self-burn intensity clamped by the LOCKED 0.30 hp-cost ceiling: the source's knife-edge 'your own skill is actively killing you and one gear mistake means you burn to death' tension softens to a strong-but-survivable tick. Walk-forward burning-aura identity, zero-button loop, and the regen race itself are intact.",
