    "kit_id": "poe1-righteous-fire",
    "mapping_json": {
      "fidelity_notes": "The crosswalk section-5 NAMES this kit for PERSISTENCE_ENGINE_uptime ('DoT/uptime ramps (RF...)') — door assignment is law-direct. DEFENSIVE_TRADEOFF carries the life/defense-trade half: the build IS the regen-vs-self-burn race. Toggle -> persistent_condition_shape=tick-cost (section-3 stance/toggle lane), the tick paid from life. SOURCE MAGNITUDE CLAMPED: the source burn is near-lethal (~90% of life+ES per second, out-regenned by stacked regen); engine hp_cost_scale is LOCKED at 0.30 max — mapped at the cap (aurabot b01 clamp precedent), so the race survives at lower stakes. Ailment burn native (fire family). Variants (Chieftain / Inquisitor / historical low-life Occultist+Guardian) collapse to the same chassis with different sustain sources. Longest-lived kit in the batch (1.x through 3.20+, 'most durable SSF progression curve of any skill gem').",
      "motion_frame": "walk-forward tank: activate RF once and simply walk — everything near the burning body melts while regen races the self-burn; throw Fire Trap at tougher targets ('For tougher targets, we'll be cursing with our Flammability & Throwing Fire Trap')",
