    "mech_note": "Righteous Fire: a toggle-aura that permanently burns the caster's body, dealing fire damage per second to all nearby enemies in a radius, scaled by fire damage bonuses and burning damage. The caster sustains the self-damage via massive life/ES regeneration (Juggernaut ascendancy, Bereks Grip, Vitality aura, life regen nodes). The offense scales via Spell Damage that says 'affects Righteous Fire' (e.g. Spell Damage increases burn). The build walks forward — proximity kills everything in the burning radius without any button presses. Scorch rune and Archmage variants add secondary offense. RF is the quintessential walk-forward tank build: everything in range burns, the caster never drops a button. Has been competitively viable for 10+ years of PoE history, with the most durable SSF progression curve of any skill gem.",
